      "source": "동아출판 프라임 영한사전",
      "matchType": "allterm:proximity:1.000000",
      "translatedText": "그는 나이가 어려서 진득한 데가 없다",
      "text": "He lacks <b>dignity</b>, being still young. or He is too young to have (any) weight of character."
